## 5. Database Relationship Design

- One Hospital can have multiple Doctors.
- One Department can have multiple Doctors.
- Each Doctor belongs to one Hospital.
- Each Doctor belongs to one Department.

Implemented the planned relationship using Spring Data JPA and Hibernate.

## 6. REST API Development Plan

| Method | Endpoint | Operation |
|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/doctors | Register Doctor |
| GET | /api/doctors | Get All Doctors |
| GET | /api/doctors/{id} | Get Doctor By ID |
| PUT | /api/doctors/{id} | Update Doctor |
| DELETE | /api/doctors/{id} | Delete Doctor |
| GET | /api/doctors/department/{departmentId} | Get Doctors By Department |
| GET | /api/doctors/hospital/{hospitalId} | Get Doctors By Hospital |
| GET | /api/doctors/specialization/{specialization} | Get Doctors By Specialization |

